# Glyph Environment Variables

# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID (required for Google Sign-In)
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create a new OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application type)
# 3. Add `http://localhost:3000` to Authorized JavaScript origins (for local dev)
# 4. Add your production URL as well
# 5. Paste the Client ID below (remove the placeholder)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com
